    if (STYLE === "colore") return "<rect x='" + x + "' y='" + y + "' width='" + w + "' height='" + h + "' rx='16' fill='#fff' stroke='" + col + "' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M" + x + " " + (y + 16) + "a16 16 0 0 1 16 -16H" + (x + w - 16) + "a16 16 0 0 1 16 16V" + (y + 46) + "H" + x + "Z' fill='" + col + "'/>";
